OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother cold feeling day, with
OL,6,Fa gentle breeze. Dry, however, with
OL,7,Fcloud moving north through the
OL,8,Fmorning, clearing in the afternoon.
OL,9,FSunny spells early and late.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIncreasingly cloudy with a
OL,12,Fstrengthening breeze through the
OL,13,Fevening. Feeling cold, with cloud
OL,14,Fbuilding from the southwest overnight,
OL,15,Fand chance of some light rain in the
OL,16,Fwest towards dawn. Frosty.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,171,160,301,260,100,100
