OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA mostly dry but frosty start.
OL,6,FCloud will thicken through the
OL,7,Fmorning, bringing outbreaks of rain
OL,8,Fspreading eastward. Less cold than of
OL,9,Flate, with a gentle breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FUnsettled with rain or showers and
OL,13,Fstrong winds at times, though some
OL,14,Fdrier and brighter intervals. Less
OL,15,Fcold than of late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
